(The point of these changes, as I understand, is simply to avoid the old `WHEEL_ZOOM_DISABLED_TIMEOUT`-based heuristic during wheel-zooming.)

```suggestion
    if (
      (typeof PDFJSDev === "undefined" || !PDFJSDev.test("MOZCENTRAL")) &&
      !("onscrollend" in document.documentElement)
    ) {
      return;
    }  
    const { mainContainer } = appConfig;
